{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09228","headline":"酬刘侍郎使君 · 韦应物","name":"酬刘侍郎使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琼树凌霜雪，葱蒨如芳春。\n英贤虽出守，本自玉阶人。\n宿昔陪郎署，出入仰清尘。\n孰云俱列郡，比德岂爲邻。\n风雨飘海气，清凉悦心神。\n重门深夏昼，赋诗延衆宾。\n方以岁月旧，每蒙君子亲。\n继作郡斋什，远赠荆山珍。\n高闲庶务理，游眺景物新。\n朋友亦远集，燕酌在佳辰。\n始唱已慙拙，将酬益难伸。\n濡毫意僶俛，一用写悁勤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}